  'traction-alopecia-nigeria', 'Traction alopecia: why your edges thin, and when it can still be reversed', 'Thinning edges from braids, weaves and tight styling are usually traction alopecia. What causes it, the early signs worth acting on, and the point after which it stops being reversible.',
